      "category": "ai",
      "title": "Understanding Positional Embeddings in Modern LLMs",
      "url": "https://magazine.sebastianraschka.com/p/understanding-positional-embeddings",
      "discuss_url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50506376",
      "score": 223,
      "comments": 27,
      "author": "vismit2000",
      "published": "2026-11-15T12:14:06Z",
      "bullets": [
        "Modern LLMs shifted from absolute sinusoidal embeddings to relative mechanisms like RoPE and ALiBi to improve sequence length generalization.",
        "RoPE injects positional information via rotation matrices in attention query-key products, powering architectures like Llama 3, Mistral, and Qwen.",
        "Context extension techniques like YaRN and NTK-aware scaling manipulate RoPE frequencies to expand context windows beyond original pretraining limits."
      ]
    },
    {
